<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>typically,<sp/>check<sp/>the<sp/>extension</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>return<sp/>true<sp/>if<sp/>the<sp/>writer<sp/>can<sp/>handle<sp/>the<sp/>format</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
